		{ String _name = "NMT30FurnitureMakerTip";		String _text = "Furniture Maker is taking Bauholz, wood, and some expensive metals and do nice furnitures. Grösse: 8x9. Kosten: 34 Baumstämme, 48 Bauholz, 32 Steine, 24 Eisen, 8 Glas. Herstellbar: furniture, fine furniture, silvered furniture, gilded furniture. Beschäftigung: 1-2 Arbeiter. Tipps: Makes some of the best Endspiel- selling Ressourcen."; }

